---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import i_process_banner from '../../assets/img/process-banner.webp';
---
<Layout title={"How We Work | Game Nock"} description={"Game Nock\u2019s development process: engagement models, eight production stages, weekly reporting, milestone demos and shared tracking."} active="how-we-work" contact={true}>
<section class="pg-hero"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">How We Work</span></nav><span class="eyebrow">How we work</span><h1>A Clear Development Process with No Production Black Box.</h1><p class="lede">You always know what is being built, what comes next and what could put the schedule at risk.</p><div class="ctas"><button class="btn btn-primary mag" data-contact>Share Your Documentation <svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button><a class="btn btn-wa-solid" href="https://wa.me/923184142473" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg><use href="#whatsapp"/></svg> Chat on WhatsApp</a></div></div></section><section class="sp "><div class="wrap"><div class="art-banner" style="aspect-ratio:3.4/1"><Picture src={i_process_banner} formats={["avif","webp"]} fallbackFormat="webp" widths={[800, 1300, 1800]} sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1180px" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Floating islands connected by a glowing path" /></div></div></section><section class="sp "><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">Engagement models</span><h2>Three Ways to Work Together</h2></div><div class="g3"><a class="glass" href="/services/complete-game-development/"><span class="gic"><svg><use href="#pad"/></svg></span><h3>Complete project ownership</h3><p>Best when you need Game Nock to manage delivery end to end.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></span></a><a class="glass" href="/services/co-development/"><span class="gic"><svg><use href="#team"/></svg></span><h3>Dedicated team</h3><p>Best when you need ongoing capacity integrated with your internal process.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></span></a><a class="glass" href="/services/multiplayer-backend/"><span class="gic"><svg><use href="#server"/></svg></span><h3>Specialised support</h3><p>Best for multiplayer, backend, optimisation or a specific feature.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section class="sp "><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">Production process</span><h2>From Discovery to Post-Launch</h2></div><ol class="ksteps" style="--n:4"><li class="glass"><h3>Discovery</h3><p>Understand the game, audience, goals and constraints.</p></li><li class="glass"><h3>Requirements validation</h3><p>Confirm features, platforms and priorities in writing.</p></li><li class="glass"><h3>Technical design</h3><p>Architecture, tools and third-party services.</p></li><li class="glass"><h3>Scope and milestone planning</h3><p>Milestones, team and estimate with risks listed.</p></li><li class="glass"><h3>Production</h3><p>Sprints with playable builds and reviews.</p></li><li class="glass"><h3>QA and optimisation</h3><p>Testing and tuning on target devices.</p></li><li class="glass"><h3>Release preparation</h3><p>Store builds, compliance and submission.</p></li><li class="glass"><h3>Post-launch support</h3><p>Fixes, updates and live-ops as agreed.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="sp "><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">Communication</span><h2>How You Stay Informed</h2></div><div class="g2"><div style="display:grid;gap:14px"><div class="glass" style="padding:22px 26px"><h3 style="font-size:18px">Weekly progress report</h3><p>What was done, what is next and anything blocking progress.</p></div><div class="glass" style="padding:22px 26px"><h3 style="font-size:18px">Milestone demonstration</h3><p>A playable build you can test at every milestone.</p></div><div class="glass" style="padding:22px 26px"><h3 style="font-size:18px">Shared project tracker</h3><p>Live visibility of tasks and priorities.</p></div><div class="glass" style="padding:22px 26px"><h3 style="font-size:18px">Risk and dependency reporting</h3><p>Problems raised early, with options to resolve them.</p></div><div class="glass" style="padding:22px 26px"><h3 style="font-size:18px">Build delivery schedule</h3><p>Agreed dates for test builds on each platform.</p></div><div class="glass" style="padding:22px 26px"><h3 style="font-size:18px">Client feedback process</h3><p>A clear way to request changes and approve work.</p></div></div>
      <div class="glass"><span class="eyebrow">Tools</span><h2 class="ttl">We Work in Your Tools</h2><ul class="facts"><li>Slack or Microsoft Teams</li><li>Jira or ClickUp</li><li>Git</li><li>TestFlight</li><li>Google Play testing tracks</li></ul><p style="margin-top:18px">If your team already uses a different tracker or chat tool, we adapt to it.</p></div></div></div></section>
</Layout>
